  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti o Misiri okoreng’anigwa neng’oina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko rie ritang’ani, omotienyi o ikomi na kabere, omwaka o ikomi na kabere, ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaacha ase inde, riganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, rera obokie amagombo igoro ya Farao, omorwoti o Misiri, omoteebie: Aye nigo kwareng’anetigwe nendo ensae ase egati y’ebisaku, nigo onga eng’iti enene mono buna eng’oina ere enyancha ime. Nigo kwaberogetie korwa ase chindooche chiao, okaburukania amaache namagoro ao, okabokia etintira y’amaache e chindooche chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Nindute ekeonga kiane igoro yao, nakio omoganda omonene orakong’use okobeke ase rikuru riane ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ngotugute igoro ase ense enyomo, na nkorute aase aarabu, agwo ndangerie chinyoni chionsi chikogwere, ne ching’iti chire ase ense engima chikorie chiigote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nintugute chinyama chi’omobere oo ase ebitunwa igoro, na oboguundo bwao boichore ase amagoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyonsie ense nemegoko y’amanyinga ao, aichore aike ase ebitunwa igoro, ne chindooche chiichorwe naro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ekio ndagosirie nintube igoro, imbeke omosunte ase ching’enang’eni; nintube erioba ne riire, na omotienyi tokobara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emebaso yonsi ya igoro ninyetube omosunte ase engencho yao, nindete omosunte ase ense yao. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero ndarentere abanto b’ebisaku amang’ana igoro y’ogosirigwa kwao, ning’ichanie chinkoro chi’ abanto abange ase chinse echio otamanyeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning’ichanie abanto abange na abarwoti babo mboboe mono ase engencho yao, ekero ndabe nkomesia omoro one ase amasio abo. Ee, ase rituko ri’okogwa kwao mbabe bakonakoiguswa kera engaki, kera omonto ase engencho y’obogima bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Omoro bw’omorwoti o Babiloni norentwe igoro yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindete abarwani chituoni, abare abatindi goetania ebisaku bionsi, abwo mbaite emeganda yao nemioro. Barabwo mbasirie obonene bwa Misiri bobe bosa, na emeganda yaye yonsi nesirigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning’ite ching’iti chionsi chikorisia mbarabare ase amaache amaange are; amagoro ya Mwanyabaanto, gose ebitaago bie ching’iti, tibikogenderera goturubania amaache ayio biyasarie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nintige amaache areo akenonoke, ne chindooche chiminyoke buna amaguta. Nab’Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ndasarie ense ya Misiri ebe bosa, na ebinto bionsi bireo bisirigwe, naende nsirie abanto bonsi bamenyeteo, erio mbamanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio naro amagombo arabokigwe igoro ya Misiri. Abakungu b’ebisaku mbabokie amagombo igoro yaye, na igoro y’emeganda yaye yonsi. Nabo Omonene ateebire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ense y’abakuure",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria ikomi na gatano, omotienyi bw’eritang’ani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "omwaka o ikomi na kabere, ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaacha ase ’nde, rigantebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, bokeria emeganda ya Misiri amagombo, obatugute abanto baye gochia inse, amo nabaanto b’ebisaku bire nobonene, bagende aase abakuure agwo ase chimbeera, ase abakuure bagendete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Misiri, ning’o obuete ase obosiani?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tirimboka ogende inse otimoke amo nabatarogeti?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abanto ba Misiri mbaitwe barare amo nabwo baitetwe nemioro. Emioro y’okobasiria yarurwe. Ase ayio rusia ense eyio aroro amo nemeganda yaye yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa agwo aase abakuure abare ne chinguru ase egati ye chituoni mbakwane igoro y’Abamisiri na abakoonyi babo, bateebe: Baria batarogeti baitirwe nemioro, baachire inse aa korara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abaasuri nao bakare amo nemeganda yabo yonsi, chimbeera chiabo nigo chibaetanaine ase chinsemo chionsi. Bonsi baitirwe nemioro bakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimbeera chiabo nigo chikare inse aatambe, na emeganda yabo nigo eetanaine chimbeera chiabo ase chinsemo chionsi. Bonsi baitirwe nemioro bakuure; abanto abwo kare barentete obwoba ase ense y’abare moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abaelamu nao bakare amo nemeganda yabo yonsi eetanaine chimbeera chiabo. Bonsi baitirwe nemioro bakuure. Abwo bonsi barentete obwoba ase ense y’abare moyo; nigo bagendete gochia aase abakuure ekero konya batararoka na bono babogoirie obosooku bwabo amo nabwo bagendire ase chimbeera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaelamu amo nemeganda yabo yonsi banyorire amarere abo ase egati y’abwo baitetwe nemioro, ne chimbeera chi’emeganda yabo nigo chibaetanaine. Abwo bonsi bagaitwa nemioro ekero konya batararoka. Agwo kare nigo barentete obwoba ase ense y’abare moyo. Bono babogoirie obosooku amo nabwo bagendire ase chimbeera, ee, nigo babekire ase egati y’abwo baitetwe nemioro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abameseki na Abatubali nao bakare amo nemeganda yabo yonsi, ne chimbeera chi’emeganda eyio nigo chibaetanaine ase chinsemo chionsi. Abwo bonsi nabaanto batarogeti, nigo baitetwe nemioro. Agwo kare nigo barentete obwoba ase ense y’abare moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Abwo batarogeti tibakorara amo ne chituoni chi’eseegi chiagendete gochia aase abakuure amo nebirwanero biabo bi’eseegi, na emioro yabo ebekire inse y’emetwe yabo, na ebibe biabo bakorete tibiatubete amauga abo? Barabwo nigo barentete obwoba ase ense y’abare moyo buna chituoni chi’eseegi chigokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naboigo nainwe Abamisiri, morasenyentwe, mokwe amo nabatarogeti, abwo baitetwe nemioro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
