              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abaedomu nao bakare amo nabarwoti babo, na abagaambi babo bonsi. Nonya barenge nokobua nigo baraire amo na baria baitetwe nemioro, batarogeti bagendete ase chimbeera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
